{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"0820c676ad433f3511909fd6951fb4fcc4ff6d4c48e9ee637e3a4d5e7b84f784","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"當把你的糧食運到海外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為日久必有收穫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當把你的投資分成七份，甚至八份，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你不知道日後會有什麼災難臨到世上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雲中滿了水，就會下雨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹不論倒向南或倒向北，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒在哪裡就躺在哪裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若總指望風輕雲淡的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必無法撒種，無法收割。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["正如你不知道風的路線，不知道骨骼在母胎中如何形成，你也無法瞭解創造萬物之上帝的作為。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你早晚都要撒種，因為你不知道什麼時候撒的會茁壯生長，或許早晚撒的長的一樣好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["光真美好，能夠看見陽光真好！"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人一生不論活多久，都要活得快樂，但不要忘記死後有許多黑暗的日子。將來的一切都是虛空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["年輕人啊，在年輕時要快樂，要在青春歲月裡使自己的心歡暢。心裡想做什麼就去做，眼睛想看什麼就去看。然而，要切記：上帝必照你所行的一切審判你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以，你要拋開心中的煩惱和肉體的痛苦，因為青春年華轉瞬即逝。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}